WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.335
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:06.120 --> 00:00:08.370
SPEAKER: We're going to
deploy a virtual machine using

00:00:08.370 --> 00:00:11.430
Cloud Deployment Manager
using Cloud Shell.

00:00:11.430 --> 00:00:14.040
Click the pencil at the top
to open the text editor.

00:00:14.040 --> 00:00:18.590
In the File menu, choose New
File and name it vm.yaml.

00:00:18.590 --> 00:00:22.350
Paste the config file from the
Quick Start into this file.

00:00:22.350 --> 00:00:24.270
First, define the
virtual machine instance

00:00:24.270 --> 00:00:26.490
using this config file.

00:00:26.490 --> 00:00:30.720
This establishes the machine
type, image family, zone, disk,

00:00:30.720 --> 00:00:32.490
and IP.

00:00:32.490 --> 00:00:33.960
Replace the
placeholder variables

00:00:33.960 --> 00:00:36.990
in the new yaml file with your
preferred project and VM image

00:00:36.990 --> 00:00:38.070
family.

00:00:38.070 --> 00:00:40.240
There are two instances
of my project,

00:00:40.240 --> 00:00:43.890
and one instance of family name.

00:00:43.890 --> 00:00:46.650
Deploy these resources
using gcloud referencing

00:00:46.650 --> 00:00:49.280
the yaml just created.

00:00:49.280 --> 00:00:50.580
Your deployment has succeeded.

00:00:50.580 --> 00:00:53.567
We now have a new
instance deployed.

00:00:53.567 --> 00:00:55.150
It's quick to check
on your deployment

00:00:55.150 --> 00:00:57.130
with the described
command in gcloud, which

00:00:57.130 --> 00:01:00.280
shows us the information about
a deployment plus any warnings

00:01:00.280 --> 00:01:02.590
or errors.

00:01:02.590 --> 00:01:04.235
Moving to the Cloud
Console Web UI,

00:01:04.235 --> 00:01:06.610
we can see that our deployment
is shown in the Deployment

00:01:06.610 --> 00:01:09.380
Manager section.

00:01:09.380 --> 00:01:10.970
Clicking in gives
us more information

00:01:10.970 --> 00:01:12.620
about the resources
included, and we

00:01:12.620 --> 00:01:15.560
can get details on the
VM from here as well.

00:01:15.560 --> 00:01:17.460
You've now completed
your first deployment.

00:01:17.460 --> 00:01:18.360
Congratulations.

00:01:18.360 --> 00:01:21.410
[MUSIC PLAYING]

